    "https://www.epfl.ch/about/working/working-at-epfl/job-openings/": {
      "title": "Job opportunities",
      "description": "Job opportunities ‒ Working at EPFL ‐ EPFL When you access EPFL websites, we may set cookies on your devices and process personal data about you in accordance with our privacy policy . You can block cookies by using your browser settings. OK Skip to content About Education Research Innovation Schools Campus Search on the site Validate Show / hide the search form Search on the site Hide the search form EN FR EN DE IT Menu … Afficher l'intégralité du fil d'Ariane About Affiche les pages de même niveau About Education Research Innovation Schools Campus Laboratories list Working at EPFL Affiche les pages de même niveau Organization and identity Associated campuses Data Presidency Vice Presidencies Working at EPFL Recruiting talent from EPFL Equality, Diversity, Inclusion Respect Sustainability News & Media Philanthropy EPFL Alumni Contact Job opportunities Affiche les pages de même niveau Job opportunities Employment conditions Faculty Welcome Apprenticeships at EPFL Civilian Service About Education Research Innovation Schools Campus In the same section Job opportunities Faculty Positions Admin & Technical Staff Scientific Staff PhD Students Apprenticeships External Companies Employment conditions Faculty Welcome Apprenticeships at EPFL Civilian Service Job opportunities Working for the Ecole polytechnique fédérale de Lausanne (EPFL) means being part of a prestigious school that consistently ranks among the top 20 universities worldwide. Professors Admin & Technical Staff Scientific Staff PhD Students Apprenticeship External Companies At EPFL, we foster a culture of respect and inclusion in the workplace. We promote a healthy work-life balance through flexible working hours and on-campus daycare and sports facilities. Our employees also benefit from belonging to a diverse community of over 18,500 people – including almost 14,000 students and 4,000 researchers – from more than 120 different countries. As a public university dedicated to improving the world around us, we have three missions: education, research and innovation. We boast one of the most dynamic university campuses in Europe and employ more than 6,500 people. Our employees perform high-value-added work in teaching and research and in the school’s administrative and technical services. Between our main campus in Lausanne and our satellite campuses in Geneva, Neuchâtel, Fribourg and Sion, our workforce is composed of more than one hundred different professions. Other links Swiss Confederation positions (french only) ETH ZH positions available ETH Board positions available MyJob – Student positions available About Organization and identity Associated Campuses Data Presidency Vice Presidencies Working at EPFL Recruiting EPFL Talents Equality, Diversity, Inclusion Respect Sustainability News & Media Philanthropy EPFL Alumni Education Admission Academic Calendar Preparatory Year (CMS) Bachelor Master Doctorate SHS Program Continuing Education - Extension School Study Management International Teaching Educational Initiatives Education & Science Outreach Infrastructures Under Development Engaging with Society Research Mission and Policy Research Domains EPFL Research Facilities Faculty Members Solutions 4 Sustainability - S4S Awards and Prizes Funding Opportunities Research Management Support From Lab to Market Research Ethics Research with Animals Open Science Innovation Industry Collaboration Innovation Initiatives Startup Launchpad Campus Services & Resources Library Restaurants, Shops & Hotels Security, Prevention & Health Sports Community & Support Chaplaincy Events Arts & Culture Associations Visit EPFL Mobility & Travel Schools & Colleges School of Architecture, Civil & Environmental Engineering ENAC School of Basic Sciences SB School of Engineering STI School of Computer & Communication Sciences IC School of Life Sciences SV College of Management of Technology CDM Practical Services & Resources Emergencies: +41 21 693 3000 Contact Map Follow EPFL on social media Follow us on Facebook Follow us on Instagram Follow us on LinkedIn Follow us on Mastodon Follow us on X Follow us on Youtube Accessibility Disclaimer Privacy policy © 2025 EPFL, all rights reserved Back to top"
    },
